{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/800359-a-child-as-a-beast-character","id":800359,"title":"A Child as a Beast character?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-04T00:42:44-08:00","id":800359,"title":"A Child as a Beast character?","content":"So I was just looking through some youtube videos when I came across a music video by Skrillex where the child molester follows this little girl into an abandoned subway system only to find himself as the girl's plaything as she uses some strange abilities to punish the jerk. As I was watching this I started to wonder if it was possible for a player to play a beast character who was the age of a child?<br /> <br /> I don't think there is really anything against it other then the fact that it means that the kid had a beastly homecoming at such a young age. Also it you would have the risk that the child might abuse their nightmare powers.<br /> <br /> On the other hand you would have the slight advantage that most people (with the exception of a few horror fanatics) wouldn't expect a child of being the monster.<br /> <br /> Also the hungers can be easily adjusted to fit such a role like: Punishment (punishing abusers and bullies), Hoard (taking all those wonderful toys), Prey (Whose the bully now), Ruin (throwing a tantrum), and Power (lording over the playground with an iron hand).<br /> <br /> So what do you all think? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":7343,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","user":"Werescythe","date":".  Added some hungers 01-04-2016, 03:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T11:19:18-08:00","id":800654,"title":"","content":"Go for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T15:22:45-08:00","id":800771,"title":"","content":"Its entirely doable. In fact there was a whole book on playing child characters.. though I think Innocents was mortal focused... not sure if it had anything for supernatural types... but one should stat a child approprietly (dont forget to take small stature as a merit)..<br /> <br /> also.. link to the music video please? =D","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2451-windrave","name":"Windrave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2451_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-04T15:53:45-08:00","id":800781,"title":"","content":"True story, I almost made one of the Ready-Made PCs a very young child character, but then I didn't. I think I'm allowed to say that, because it didn't happen.<br /> <br /> Anyone who knows me or follows my writing on Facebook or the ongoing Star Wars fanfiction that may or may not be my baby knows that my favorite things to write are child characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:12px\">-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3093-hm8453a","name":"hm8453a","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3093_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"636"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T13:20:15-08:00","id":802301,"title":"","content":"Not to mention how creepy it would be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-15T20:01:34-08:00","id":810035,"title":"","content":"Nothing wrong with it. The rest of the Beast Community might actually be a bit weirded out by such a young person becoming one of them wondering just how powerful they will grow as they age, and a few might be worried the child might bring down a swarm of heroes due to lack of maturity and general childish behavior. Depending on how well the community is organized in your game might determine how well this character goes over. At worst case you might have to have a chaperone constantly because your siblings don't trust you not to cause problems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}